  maxHealth: 300
  contactDamage: 2
  scoreReward: 6000
  description: The first thing that learned doors do not need walls. It carries a
    caged portal on a staff the way a jailer carries keys - proudly, and at you.
  tactics: 'The rift tutorial boss (difficulty 5): telegraphed squares open AT YOUR
    POSITION and erupt rings a moment later - the square is where you WERE, so simply
    keep moving. Threshold (below half) adds random-position crosses: track two squares
    at once, never stand on either.'
  displayName: The Riftwarden
